 exact BloomRightFNX (R K) (R T) _ _ _ _ _ (P.NobleΦNX K K m H) (P.NobleΦNX T T m H) (P.NobleΦNX K T m H) (CantlePointNX p m K hm Ao X p0) (CantlePointNX p m T hm Ao Y p1)
